# CR 702.12b/704.5g: Indestructible skips destroyDamagedCreatures entirely
# (action.go's own !c.HasKeyword("Indestructible") guard), so Spearbreaker
# Behemoth (5/5, Indestructible) survives Craw Giant's 6 power -- well past
# its own 5 toughness -- with the damage still marked. Behemoth's own 5
# power is exactly lethal to the Giant's 4 toughness, no indestructibility
# to save it.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
